## Day 6: Hands-on Practice
### Morning: Small Tasks
1. Add Logging:
   ```java
   private static final Logger log = LoggerFactory.getLogger(YourClass.class);
   
   public Mono<Plan> getPlan(String id) {
       log.debug("Fetching plan with id: {}", id);
       return planRepository.findById(id)
           .doOnSuccess(plan -> log.info("Found plan: {}", plan.getId()))
           .doOnError(ex -> log.error("Error finding plan: {}", ex.getMessage()));
   }
   ```

2. Add Simple Feature:
   ```java
   // Add a method to existing service
   public Mono<Boolean> isPlanActive(String planId) {
       return getPlan(planId)
           .map(plan -> plan.getStatus().equals("ACTIVE"))
           .defaultIfEmpty(false);
   }
   ```

