## Debugging Tips

### Basic Debugging
1. Add Strategic Breakpoints:
   ```java
   // Add in service methods:
   public Mono<Plan> getPlan(String id) {
       // Breakpoint here
       return planRepository.findById(id);
   }
   ```

2. Use Logging for Flow Tracking:
   ```java
   log.info("Starting process for plan: {}", planId);
   log.debug("Data received: {}", data);
   log.error("Error occurred: {}", ex.getMessage(), ex);
   ```

### Advanced Debugging
1. Reactive Debug Points:
   ```java
   // Add checkpoints in chains
   return planRepository.findById(id)
       .doOnNext(plan -> log.debug("Plan found: {}", plan))
       .doOnError(ex -> log.error("Error: {}", ex))
       .doFinally(signal -> log.debug("Operation completed"));
   ```

2. Use IDE Debug Features:
   - Conditional breakpoints
   - Watch expressions
   - Evaluate expressions

